    "localSourcePatches": {
      "P3": "Context-aware shared Gateway lifecycle/writers; bounded ingress and callback join; ordered raw host observer and detached Before snapshots; uppercase STAGE_INSTANCE_* registration; corrected API/voice endpoint initialization. Parent-approved Go1.27 vet correction uses a literal %s format for ErrUnauthorized informational logging in RequestWithLockedBucket; no module API/behavior change. Parent-assigned Message.UnmarshalJSON partial-components correction preserves omitted nil versus present empty slice, avoiding implicit cache component deletion on partial MESSAGE_UPDATE.",
